a, M. Sadrosadati, J. S. Kim, G. F. Oliveira, T. Shahroodi, A. Nori, and O. Mutlu, “PLUTo: Enabling massively parallel computation in DRAM via lookup tables,” in <em>Proc. 55th IEEE/ACM Int. Symp. Microarchitecture (MICRO)</em>, Oct. 2022, pp. 900–919.","title":"PLUTo: Enabling massively parallel computation in DRAM via lookup tables","links":{"documentLink":"/document/9923887","pdfLink":"/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=9923887","accessType":{"type":"subscribed","message":"Included in Your Digital Subscription"},"accessToolTip":"Included in Your Digital Subscription","accessIcon":"icon.access.subscribed.png","articleNumber":"9923887","doi":"10.1109/MICRO56248.2022.00067","pdfSize":"1342","openUrlImgLoc":"/assets/img/btn.find-in-library.png"},"googleScholarStructredQuery":"title=PLUTo: Enabling massively parallel computation in DRAM via lookup tables&doi=10.1109/MICRO56248.2022.00067","googleScholarLink":"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?hl=en&title=PLUTo: Enabling massively parallel computation in DRAM via lookup tables&doi=10.1109/MICRO56248.2022.00067","refType":"biblio","id":"ref7","errorMsg":""},{"order":"8","text":"J. H. Kim, S. Kang, S. Lee, H. Kim, Y. Ro, S. Lee, D. Wang, J. Choi, J. So, Y. Cho, J.-H. Song, J. Cho, K. Sohn, and N. S. Kim, “Aquabolt-XL HBM2-PIM, LPDDR5-PIM with in-memory processing, and AXDIMM with acceleration buffer,” <em>IEEE Micro</em>, vol. 42, no. 3, pp. 20–30, Apr. 2022.","title":"Aquabolt-XL HBM2-PIM, LPDDR5-PIM with in-memory processing, and AXDIMM with acceleration buffer","links":{"documentLink":"/document/9749869","pdfLink":"/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=9749869","accessType":{"type":"subscribed","message":"Included in Your Digital Subscription"},"accessToolTip":"Included in Your Digital Subscription","accessIcon":"icon.access.subscribed.png","articleNumber":"9749869","doi":"10.1109/MM.2022.3164651","pdfSize":"5295","openUrlImgLoc":"/assets/img/btn.find-in-library.png"},"googleScholarStructredQuery":"title=Aquabolt-XL HBM2-P